<title>CANADA: Canada dlr closes weaker after bank intervention.</title>
<headline>Canada dlr closes weaker after bank intervention.</headline>
<text>
<p>FORECAST RANGE   1.3920/1.3970	    ASIAN CLOSE     1.3903</p>
<p>RESISTANCE 1.3830   SUPPORT 1.3400	HI 1.3930   LO  1.3904</p>
<p>CANADA OPEN  1.3926/31    HI 1.3965     EUROPE OPEN     1.3928</p>
<p>PREV CLOSE   1.3905/10    LO 1.3909     HI 1.3916   LO  1.3906</p>
<p>---------------------MARKET COMMENT--------------------------</p>
<p>* Canada's dollar closed at C$1.3944 (US$0.7171) in moderate trading on Wednesday after the Bank of Canada intervened repeatedly to buy Canada dollars near the C$1.3960 (US$0.7163), traders said. * They said weakness in the currency was prompted by strong broad-based interest to sell Canada dollars through the session.</p>
